description=⚡ Mesin performa game-only untuk Mi 9 (cepheus): CPU & GPU dipaku di clock maks, thermal unlock, touch ngebut, DDR + network boost, bypass charging. Nyala saat game, balik 100% stok saat keluar. WebUI 3 tab, tanpa mode ribet.
